The VST3 SDK pin moved from v3.7.6_build_18 (GPLv3 or Steinberg proprietary
licence) to v3.8.0_build_66 on 2026-10-31. Steinberg released v3.8.0 under the
MIT License (2025-10-20), so a VST3 built from this tree no longer carries the
GPLv3/proprietary condition. Binaries built from older revisions of this
repository (VST3 SDK 3.7.x) still do. Build with -DCLARA_BUILD_VST3=OFF to
produce only the CLAP plugin and ARA library, which don't use the VST3 SDK.

clap-wrapper is pinned to v0.14.0 (the first release that defaults to
VST3 SDK 3.8.0).

